          "name": "Theft of Vitae",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "Once every 1d4+1 rounds, a human trap can drain the blood from a target within 30 feet. The target must make a Fortitude save (DC 13) or take 1d8 points of shadow damage and the human trap is healed for that much. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 1st level spell (Knowledge: Nature DC 17). The save DC is Wisdom-based.",
